    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/d83075-f0/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_PRODUCT&editorId=516582444372067448&sectionId=516582444489507960)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrykSFDeh5_text","label":"ggrykSFDeh5_text","default":"Here's why you need Gudslip®:"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzV9M1CpsU_text","label":"ggzV9M1CpsU_text","default":"<p><strong>01</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcSlPlQttH_text","label":"ggcSlPlQttH_text","default":"Your Snoring is<br>Problematic"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9Gym9QZ-2_text","label":"gg9Gym9QZ-2_text","default":"<p>Snoring can strain relationships and interrupt sleep for both you and your partner. Gudslip® Mouth Tape helps keep your mouth closed and promotes nasal breathing, significantly reducing snoring and creating a quieter sleep environment.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaqT3HzdCu_text","label":"ggaqT3HzdCu_text","default":"<p><strong>02</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1gioreBj-_text","label":"gg1gioreBj-_text","default":"Your Mouth is Dry&nbsp;<br>in the Morning"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYYHQf6wau_text","label":"ggYYHQf6wau_text","default":"<p>Waking up with a dry mouth is uncomfortable and can be harmful to your dental health. By using Gudslip® Mouth Tape to promote nasal breathing, you'll retain more moisture in your mouth overnight, improving your comfort and oral health.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKLlHNi-Jd_text","label":"ggKLlHNi-Jd_text","default":"<p><strong>03</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPtd6ncMvP_text","label":"ggPtd6ncMvP_text","default":"Your sleep is<br>disrupted"},{"type":"html","id":"ggk60ZHpt00_text","label":"ggk60ZHpt00_text","default":"<p>If you often wake up feeling tired despite a full night's sleep, your breathing might be the culprit. Gudslip® Mouth Tape ensures you breathe through your nose, reducing disruptions and enhancing the quality of your sleep.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyDv68HY4W_text","label":"ggyDv68HY4W_text","default":"Wake Up With Energy"},{"type":"html","id":"ggK1S5Ij8uS_text","label":"ggK1S5Ij8uS_text","default":"<p>Start your day with a burst of energy. It promotes optimal nighttime breathing, enhancing oxygen intake and stabilizing sleep patterns. Its gentle adhesive ensures comfort throughout the night, reducing disruptions and encouraging deeper sleep cycles. By promoting nasal breathing, it not only reduces snoring but also improves REM sleep, ensuring you wake up feeling refreshed and energized, ready to tackle your day with vigor.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtc1sP8PAO_childItem_0","label":"ggtc1sP8PAO_childItem_0","default":"<p>Start your day with renewed energy</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtc1sP8PAO_childItem_1","label":"ggtc1sP8PAO_childItem_1","default":"<p>Promotes clearer skin</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggtc1sP8PAO_childItem_2","label":"ggtc1sP8PAO_childItem_2","default":"<p>Gentle, breathable fabric</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAABhXPfiM_text","label":"ggAABhXPfiM_text","default":"<p><strong>01</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_yHW0vMth_text","label":"gg_yHW0vMth_text","default":"Your Snoring is Problematic"},{"type":"html","id":"ggIVOwN4AaN_text","label":"ggIVOwN4AaN_text","default":"<p>Snoring can strain relationships and interrupt sleep for both you and your partner. Gudslip® Mouth Tape helps keep your mouth closed and promotes nasal breathing, significantly reducing snoring and creating a quieter sleep environment.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gghV4hSg-uP_text","label":"gghV4hSg-uP_text","default":"<p><strong>02</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEyfhjdv6K_text","label":"ggEyfhjdv6K_text","default":"Your mouth is dry in the morning"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHk3xFpDz0_text","label":"ggHk3xFpDz0_text","default":"<p>Waking up with a dry mouth is uncomfortable and can be harmful to your dental health. By using Gudslip® Mouth Tape to promote nasal breathing, you'll retain more moisture in your mouth overnight, improving your comfort and oral health.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCuxS31-rU_text","label":"ggCuxS31-rU_text","default":"<p><strong>03</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg92EKv575D_text","label":"gg92EKv575D_text","default":"Your sleep is disrupted"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4C3PvldvH_text","label":"gg4C3PvldvH_text","default":"<p>If you often wake up feeling tired despite a full night's sleep, your breathing might be the culprit. Gudslip® Mouth Tape ensures you breathe through your nose, reducing disruptions and enhancing the quality of your sleep.</p>"}],
